@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
### GET all shifts
GET {{baseUrl}}/shifts?sortBy=date

### GET shift by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/shifts/85f6a9a3-dcc5-42d0-86cc-4dea61088d1d

### POST shift
POST {{baseUrl}}/shifts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Yaroslav",
  "date": "2026-06-21",
  "time": "morning",
  "status": "completed"
}

### PUT shift
PUT {{baseUrl}}/shifts/85f6a9a3-dcc5-42d0-86cc-4dea61088d1d
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "completed",
  "comment": "fff"
}

### DELETE shift
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/shifts/85f6a9a3-dcc5-42d0-86cc-4dea61088d1d

### Stats on shifts
GET {{baseUrl}}/shifts/stats

### Top 3 users by shifts count
GET {{baseUrl}}/shifts/top3users?date=2026-05-01